<title>USA: Simtek names new chief operating officer.</title>
<headline>Simtek names new chief operating officer.</headline>
<dateline>COLORADO SPRINGS, Colo. 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Simtek Corp said Tuesday it has appointed Douglas Mitchell as chief operating officer and executive vice president.</p>
<p>Most recently, Mitchell has been president and chief executive of Momentum Microsystems.</p>
<p>Simtek said that Richard Petritz will remain as president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Simtek develops, produces and markets high performance nonvolatile semiconductor memories.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
